### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8006
@token = your-jwt-token-here
@internalToken = my-secret-token

### Health Check - Live
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Health Check - Ready
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Prometheus Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

### Root
GET {{baseUrl}}/

#####################
# Public API (JWT required)
#####################

### Create Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: unique-key-123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "workspace_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001",
  "purpose": "SUBSCRIPTION",
  "plan_code": "pro-monthly",
  "amount": 299.00,
  "currency": "UAH",
  "return_url": "https://example.com/payment/return",
  "metadata": {
    "campaign": "summer-2026"
  }
}

### Get Payment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/payments/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List User Payments
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/payments?limit=50&offset=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

#####################
# Internal API (X-Internal-Token required)
#####################

### Create Payment (Internal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/internal/payments
X-Internal-Token: {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "workspace_id": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174001",
  "purpose": "SUBSCRIPTION",
  "plan_code": "pro-monthly",
  "amount": 299.00,
  "currency": "UAH"
}

### Get Payment by ID (Internal)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/internal/payments/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
X-Internal-Token: {{internalToken}}

### Refund Payment (Internal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/internal/payments/123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000/refund
X-Internal-Token: {{internalToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 299.00,
  "reason": "User requested refund"
}

#####################
# Webhooks (No auth - signature verification)
#####################

### WayForPay Webhook (Approved)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/webhooks/wayforpay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantAccount": "test_merchant",
  "orderReference": "ORDER_1234567890",
  "merchantSignature": "signature-here",
  "amount": 299.00,
  "currency": "UAH",
  "authCode": "123456",
  "cardPan": "4***1111",
  "transactionStatus": "Approved",
  "reasonCode": 1100,
  "createdDate": 1705244400,
  "processingDate": 1705244401,
  "fee": 5.98,
  "paymentSystem": "card"
}

### WayForPay Webhook (Declined)
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/webhooks/wayforpay
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "merchantAccount": "test_merchant",
  "orderReference": "ORDER_1234567890",
  "merchantSignature": "signature-here",
  "amount": 299.00,
  "currency": "UAH",
  "transactionStatus": "Declined",
  "reasonCode": 1101,
  "reason": "Insufficient funds",
  "createdDate": 1705244400
}
